  "scope": [
    "The trial skips operand-repair traversal only when all transport replacement maps are empty. Fresh ordinary-edge checks still run before route discovery. One exact-helper differential test passes128 complete IR/alias/machine comparisons over shared argument storage, loops and scoped integer/float replacements. Its first unused-import harness failure executes no tests and remains.",
    "Eight primary source-to-Object compiles run serially inABBA/BAAB order with same61flags+scheduling2 and no concurrent heavy build/test/profile/hash/archive work. Compiler phases and cleanup are slower in both blocks, with higher RSS; a tiny instruction saving does not establish a useful improvement. The source and qualified default profiling executable are restored. No balanced full-native cohort is run for the rejected trial.",
    "Both screens,14paired fixtures and both cached complete-executable gates reproduce every source/bytecode/Object/metadata/executable byte. No language/grammar change, weaker proof check, scalar retirement or fresh emitted-program runtime campaign is claimed.",
    "Two separate current-worker stack samples use the qualified source1090/compiler1d with same61flags+scheduling2 and unchanged outputs. Sampled process time and counters are diagnostic, excluded from primary means. Launcher/worker waiting observations are not CPU-time shares; no exclusive phase-time claim is made.",
    "All raw observations, source/patches, exact helper test/harness, failures, outputs, samples and native linker inputs are included. Compiler/test binaries and intermediates are excluded/SHA-pinned. Pure replay validates saved data without rebuilding/rerunning timing. Sub-ten-second complete compilation remains unachieved."
